    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_LEADER_DUSAN_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Stefan Dusan</Text>
    </Replace>

    <Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_BROTHERHOOD_UNITY_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Brotherhood, Unity and Five Year Plan</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_BROTHERHOOD_UNITY_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Pre-Communism: Cities with an Industrial Zone get +1 Production and +1 Science. Under Communism: +100 Production and Science in all cities. Industrial Zones output Science equal to their Production; Campuses output Production equal to their Science.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_MOUNTAIN_FOX_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>The Mountain Fox</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_MOUNTAIN_FOX_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Holy Sites receive triple adjacency from Hills and Mountains. Holy Sites generate Gold equal to their Faith output. Purchase military land units with Faith from turn 1 at a 20% discount.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_RALLY_OF_THE_PEOPLE_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Nationalist Mobilization</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_RALLY_OF_THE_PEOPLE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Monuments yield double Culture. War Weariness reduced by 50%. Early game (to Renaissance): +50% War Weariness. From Industrial Era: War Weariness is 0%. Military and siege units gain +10 Combat Strength when attacking cities or districts.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_DUSANS_CODE_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Dusan's Code</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_DUSANS_CODE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Conquered cities generate +2 Loyalty and +2 Culture per turn. Capturing a city in a Golden Age grants +1 Wildcard Policy slot for the remainder of the era.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <Replace Tag="LOC_DIPLO_QUOTE_TITO" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Zivelo bratstvo i jedinstvo nasih naroda!</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_DIPLO_QUOTE_DRAZA" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Za kralja i otadzbinu, sa verom u Boga!</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_DIPLO_QUOTE_MILOSEVIC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Niko ne sme da vas bije!</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_DIPLO_QUOTE_DUSAN" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Carstvo nemacko, carstvo srpsko.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <!-- BUILDING -->
    <Replace Tag="LOC_BUILDING_MANASTIR_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Manastir</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_BUILDING_MANASTIR_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Serbian unique building that replaces the Temple. Provides +3 Faith, +1 Culture, and 1 Great Work of Relic slot.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <!-- IMPROVEMENT -->
    <Replace Tag="LOC_IMPROVEMENT_SPOMENIK_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Spomenik</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_IMPROVEMENT_SPOMENIK_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Serbian unique improvement. Build on Hills. Provides +2 Culture, +1 Faith, and Tourism. Defensive units on or adjacent gain +3 Combat Strength.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <!-- UNITS -->
    <Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_PARTIZANI_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Partizani</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_PARTIZANI_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Serbian unique Infantry replacement (Tito). Combat Strength 75. +7 Combat Strength in Hills and Woods. 20% cheaper to produce.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_CHETNIK_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Chetnik</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_CHETNIK_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Serbian unique Musketman replacement (Draza). +2 Movement on Hills. +10 Combat Strength when defending in Hills or Mountains.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_NEVA_M_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Neva-M Anti-Air Battery</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_NEVA_M_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Serbian unique Anti-Air replacement (Milosevic). +100 damage against aircraft. Sorry we did not know it was invisible.</Text>
    </Replace>

    <Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_ALEMANNIC_GUARD_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Almanska Garda</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_ALEMANNIC_GUARD_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Serbian unique Knight replacement (Dusan). +5 Combat Strength in foreign territory. 20% cheaper to maintain.</Text>
    </Replace>

